00:01:13.603 --> 00:01:16.080
You can't just decide you're 
gonna an entrepreneur.

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:17.889
I think a lot of people have 
been extending their

00:01:17.889 --> 00:01:21.584
college lives and disguising 
it as entrepreneurship.

00:01:21.584 --> 00:01:23.739
I worked fucking 
hard for my money.

00:01:23.739 --> 00:01:26.027
I came here with zero.

00:01:26.027 --> 00:01:29.024
I didn't have a single 
fucking vacation day

00:01:29.024 --> 00:01:31.631
or weekend since 
I was in the seventh grade.

00:01:31.631 --> 00:01:34.459
I'm not pumped 
about losing my money.

00:01:34.459 --> 00:01:37.520
You have a lot of people
that are built DNA-wise and

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:41.259
skill-wise and have studied
and went through school

00:01:41.259 --> 00:01:43.987
and have been formed
and have trained to be

00:01:43.987 --> 00:01:46.306
unbelievable consultants at
Bain and McKinsey

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:48.016
