things of that nature

00:01:54.103 --> 00:01:58.417
who are starting consumer 
apps out the gate and

00:01:58.417 --> 00:02:01.476
have no fucking clue how 
to be a true-bred entrepreneur

00:02:01.476 --> 00:02:03.241
because they don't 
have the stomach to deal

00:02:03.241 --> 00:02:04.618
when the market says 
"Go fuck yourself."

00:02:04.618 --> 00:02:06.900
I think that we've just 
lived through the Golden Era

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:09.263
of people saying 
they were entrepreneurs

00:02:09.263 --> 00:02:11.863
but what they were was
they were operators

00:02:11.863 --> 00:02:15.371
that were building machines
A.K.A. companies that were

00:02:15.371 --> 00:02:17.729
built for financial arbitrage.

00:02:17.729 --> 00:02:20.363
People have been building 
startups that are predicated

00:02:20.363 --> 00:02:22.010
on raising the next round.

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:24.931
You've been building your 
company for user growth

00:02:24.931 --> 00:02:26.241
to raise your next round.

00:02:26.241 --> 00:02:27.320
You're not building a company.

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:31.572
We are lacking 
self-awareness in this space

00:02:31.572 --> 00:02:33.109
in a very substantial way.

00:02:33.109 --> 00:02:35.880
And there's a lot of people
that are about to met with

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.802
a lot of disappointment,
and are stuggling

00:02:37.802 --> 00:02:40.125
and one thing we're not
talking about is the

00:02:40.125 --> 00:02:41.258
level of success.

00:02:41.258 --> 00:02:43.573
Everybody thinks they 
have to build fucking Uber.

00:02:43.573 --> 00:02:46.456
Everybody thinks they have 
to make millions of dollars.

00:02:46.456 --> 00:02:48.561
It's unbelievable 
what we've done and

00:02:48.561 --> 00:02:50.980
I absolutely want
to make sure that

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.714
we're starting to have 
real conversations.

00:02:52.714 --> 00:02:56.452
Making $100,000 a year
that's massively successful.

00:02:56.452 --> 00:02:59.632
We need to recalibrate
what success looks like

00:02:59.632 --> 00:03:03.718
in our space because we're 
forcing through the branding of

00:03:03.718 --> 00:03:07.914
what we're doing 
very impractical, very high risk,

00:03:07.914 --> 00:03:11.322
very low return results 
for so many 'cause

00:03:11.322 --> 00:03:13.638
everybody is shooting 
for $10 billion.

00:03:13.638 --> 00:03:14.801
And if we keep telling

00:03:14.801 --> 00:03:17.050
everybody that it's
so easy to do it.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:20.381
And if we don't start talking 
about that the entry level

00:03:20.381 --> 00:03:24.769
to be in the top 1% earners in
America is only $400,000 a year.

00:03:24.769 --> 00:03:27.121
And I use the word only 
because nobody here is

00:03:27.121 --> 00:03:31.668
even in the mindset of 
million dollar or bust, right?

00:03:31.668 --> 00:03:34.009
We need to start 
having proper conversations.

